      "cooked": "<p>I recently tried the \"Freedom Six vs. Iron Legacy\" game, and it was definitely an experience.&nbsp; Has anyone ever tried any OTHER six-hero games?&nbsp; I know the game isn't balanced for them, but have you tried to see what would happen?</p><p>(As an aside, where exactly is it stated that F6 vs. IL is a legal game despite the usual limit of five players?&nbsp; It doesn't seem to be in the \"rulebook\" for Shattered Timelines, unless it's hidden somewhere I didn't see it.)</p>",
